msgid "This is not a rejection of the internet or collaboration. Instead, it is a fundamental rethinking of where data lives, who owns it, and how applications should behave. For developers building personal software, particularly in sensitive domains like finance, health, and personal productivity, local-first architecture offers compelling advantages that cloud-first approaches simply cannot match."
msgstr "This is not a rejection of the internet or collaboration. Instead, it is a fundamental rethinking of where data lives, who owns it, and how applications should behave. For developers building personal software, particularly in sensitive domains like finance, health, and personal productivity, local-first architecture offers compelling advantages that cloud-first approaches simply cannot match."

