#: src/app/[lang]/blog/open-source-budgeting-transparency/page.tsx:708
msgid "We believe that restrictive licensing undermines the trust benefits of open source. If you cannot freely examine and share the code, the transparency is incomplete."
msgstr "We believe that restrictive licensing undermines the trust benefits of open source. If you cannot freely examine and share the code, the transparency is incomplete."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/open-source-budgeting-transparency/page.tsx:959
msgid "We believe that welcoming security research makes Budgie safer for everyone. Researchers who examine our code are doing us and our users a service."
msgstr "We believe that welcoming security research makes Budgie safer for everyone. Researchers who examine our code are doing us and our users a service."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/budgie-offline-financial-data/page.tsx:538
msgid "We believe this tradeoff is worth it for financial data. The convenience of automatic cloud sync comes at the cost of your data existing on servers you do not control. For many types of data, that tradeoff is acceptable. For your complete financial history, we think local control is worth the extra steps."
msgstr "We believe this tradeoff is worth it for financial data. The convenience of automatic cloud sync comes at the cost of your data existing on servers you do not control. For many types of data, that tradeoff is acceptable. For your complete financial history, we think local control is worth the extra steps."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/budgie-offline-financial-data/page.tsx:902
msgid "We cannot provide your data to law enforcement or anyone else because we do not have it. There is no server to subpoena, no database to query, and no backup to hand over. Your data is on your device, protected by your device security and Budgie’s encryption."
msgstr "We cannot provide your data to law enforcement or anyone else because we do not have it. There is no server to subpoena, no database to query, and no backup to hand over. Your data is on your device, protected by your device security and Budgie’s encryption."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/budgie-offline-financial-data/page.tsx:926
