msgid "When you hand over your financial data to an app, you’re trusting it with some of the most sensitive information about your life. Your spending patterns reveal where you live, where you work, what you eat, your health conditions, your relationships, and countless other intimate details. Yet most people have no idea what happens to this data once it enters their budget app."
